  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Flash Canin, at 23 avenue Pasteur in Antibes, is a grooming salon dedicated to dogs and cats of all breeds. The business register (Infogreffe and the data.gouv.fr business directory) lists it at this address, under SIRET 849 259 692 00028, as a simplified joint-stock company registered at the Antibes registry, main establishment open, activity "other personal services" (code 96.09Z).</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The Pages Jaunes directory (via Mappy) shows opening Tuesday to Saturday from 9am to 7pm, and payment by card, cheque or cash; the salon's description there announces a welcome for dogs and cats of all breeds, attentive to the animal's needs. The number 04 93 34 21 34 is the one shown on the establishment's Google Maps listing, which links to a "Flash Canin" Facebook page. Customer reviews there praise an attentive groomer and a salon accessible to small and large dogs alike. No price is published. A call before coming remains the surest way to check availability.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before dropping by, especially on a Monday or Sunday, days when the directory gives no opening.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Vieux Antibes and its ramparts are within walking distance from avenue Pasteur, a good opportunity for a walk after grooming.</p>
    </div>

